@Zoryn.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5202

GET {{Zoryn.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{Zoryn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

