# @name login
POST {{Zoryn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "analyst@zoryn.test",
  "password": "ChangeMe!123"
}

###

GET {{Zoryn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

